id: pmc-k1oq
title: Include extension-registered item types in changelog generation and body previews
description: pm-changelog 2026.9.23 resolves configured item types but omits active extension registrations. A closed Changeset created by the version-control package is visible in pm list but absent from changelog generation. Resolve the active registry through the public SDK for enumeration and body enrichment.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
