author: codex
acceptance_criteria: Generate and export include an extension-registered Changeset alongside configured Story and built-in Task; body preview loads its real body; regression fails before the fix; package gates pass.
resolution: Resolve configured and active extension types in enumeration and body enrichment; verify both open and default closed selection.
expected_result: Closed extension Changesets appear in default generated and exported changelogs.
actual_result: "All four linked verification commands passed: custom-type acceptance, full coverage, docstrings, and typecheck; default closed output includes only the closed Changeset."
