  "2026-09-25T15:00:50.960Z",codex,"Duplicate check: all-status custom-type search and live open/in-progress inventory found only closed pmc-vnke, whose accepted fix covered configured Story types. This recurrence is the distinct active extension-registration path, observed from pm-cli pm-g0b88h."
  "2026-09-25T15:03:43.339Z",codex,"TDD reproduced with a real temporary tracker and active schema extension: generation returned 2 items instead of 3, omitting the extension-owned Changeset while configured Story and built-in Task were present. The repair passes getActiveExtensionRegistrations into the existing public SDK type-registry resolver for both metadata enumeration and body lookup."
  "2026-09-25T15:05:04.591Z",codex,"The red-green fixture now returns all three records for generate/export and includes the actual extension-owned body in previews. Package typecheck, full coverage suite and docstring gate pass. The package coverage tool measures line/branch/function axes; its existing statement-metric work remains pmc-ilrh and is not falsely claimed complete."
  "2026-09-25T15:17:20.381Z",codex,"Addressed PR #211 review: added closed extension Changeset acceptance for default generate/export filters, preserving the existing explicit-open cases. Linked and ran all four verification commands through pm; all pass with zero failure categories, including full coverage, docstrings, and typecheck."
